WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.410
Before anyone else, give yourselves the loudest round of applause

2
00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.070
for making it here this evening.

3
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:07.570
You're looking spectacular.

4
00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.290
Make some noise for yourselves. Come on.

5
00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.590
Thank you. Thank you.

6
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:15.150
Can you promise me that you will applaud for all the winners who will take

7
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:16.010
the stage this evening?

8
00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:16.770
Is that a promise?
